</span></p><p begin="0:29.280" end="0:31.470" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:29.280" end="0:29.460">I'm</span> <span begin="0:29.460" end="0:29.940">starting</span> <span begin="0:29.940" end="0:30.060">to</span> <span begin="0:30.060" end="0:30.480">spin</span><span begin="0:30.480" end="0:30.480">,</span> <span begin="0:30.480" end="0:30.900">needles</span> <span begin="0:30.900" end="0:31.020">and</span> <span begin="0:31.020" end="0:31.470">pins</span></p><p begin="0:31.470" end="0:34.200" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:31.470" end="0:31.710">Right</span> <span begin="0:31.710" end="0:31.830">on</span> <span begin="0:31.830" end="0:31.920">the</span> <span begin="0:31.920" end="0:32.340">brim</span><span begin="0:32.340" end="0:32.340">,</span> <span begin="0:32.340" end="0:32.670">hand</span> <span begin="0:32.670" end="0:32.760">on</span> <span begin="0:32.760" end="0:32.820">a</span> <span begin="0:32.820" end="0:33.270">limb</span><span begin="0:33.270" end="0:33.270">,</span> <span begin="0:33.270" end="0:33.660">taking</span> <span begin="0:33.660" end="0:33.840">it</span> <span begin="0:33.840" end="0:34.200">in</span></p><p begin="0:34.380" end="0:37.290" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="0:34.380" end="0:34.770">Sleep</span> <span begin="0:34.770" end="0:34.860">it</span> <span begin="0:34.860" end="0:35.370">away</span><span begin="0:35.370" end="0:35.370">,</span> <span begin="0:35.370" end="0:35.700">life</span> <span begin="0:35.700" end="0:35.790">in</span> <span begin="0:35.790" end="0:35.880">a</span> <span begin="0:35.880" end="0:36.210">day</span><span begin="0:36.210" end="0:36.210">,</span> <span begin="0:36.210" end="0:36.360">and</span> <span begin="0:36.360" end="0:36.570">day</span> <span begin="0:36.570" end="0:36.690">in</span> <span begin="0:36.690" end="0:36.780">a</span> <span begin="0:36.780" end="0:37.290">life</span></p><p begin="0:37.290" end="0:39.210" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><sp